Dear Sir,
Good morning..!

=20

Please find below the details of our OCTG Inspection and Maintenance
services for your reference:

=20

OCTG Inspection and Maintenance Services

*	Drill Pipe Inspection
*	BHA Tools Inspection
*	Casing and Tubing Inspection
*	Visual Thread Inspection
*	Full-Length Magnetic Particle Examination
*	Special End Area Inspection
*	End Area UT Shear Wave Inspection
*	Dimensional and Visual Inspections
*	EMI Inspection
*	Full-Length API Drift
*	Drilling Handling Tools Inspection
*	Tools Refacing
*	Structural NDT Inspection (Masts & Substructures)
*	Drill Pipe Straightening Service
*	UTG for Stand Pipes
*	Slickline and Wireline Tools Inspection

=20

Additional Services

*	Drill Pipe Straightening =96 Correcting bent or bowed drill pipes to
ensure optimal performance.
*	Refacing =96 Reconditioning worn tool joints to restore original
dimensions and efficiency.
*	Thread Inspection and Repair =96 Inspecting and restoring damaged or
worn threads on OCTG components.
*	Non-Destructive Testing (NDT) =96 Includes ultrasonic, magnetic
particle, and eddy current testing to detect internal and external =
flaws.
*	Drilling Handling Tools & CAT IV Inspection =96 Dismantling, blasting,
inspection, reassembling, repainting, and maintenance of drilling tools =
such
as elevators, slips, and spiders.
*	Water Blasting =96 Internal and external cleaning for all types of
downhole tools (e.g., drill pipe, BHA, tubing, casing).

=20

Summary of Services

=20

Inspection Services

*	Drill Pipe
*	BHA Tools
*	Casing and Tubing
*	Dimensional and Visual Thread
*	End Area UT Shear Wave
*	EMI
*	Drilling Handling Tools
*	UT Gauging
*	Slickline and Wireline Tools
*	Non-Destructive Testing

Maintenance Services

*	Drill Pipe Straightening
*	Connections Refacing
*	Thread Inspection and Repair
*	Drilling Handling Tools & CAT IV Inspection
*	Water Blasting

=20

=20

Kind Regards

=20

From Aries Group, Qatar=20
Aswin Asokan=20
